	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d8f:
	ZH 1:
	'It was the demon Lei,'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'a man who could touch no other'
	R
	'due to his body that constantly'
	R
	'discharged electricity.'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'Lei looked down on the city'
	R
	'after the fight and gently put'
	R
	'on his insulated gloves.'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'It was a custom he had for'
	R
	'when a fight had ended.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmph...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d8f:
	ZH 1:
	'A pain like his heart had been'
	R
	'pricked by a small thorn ran'
	R
	'through Lei.'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'He always felt that way after a'
	R
	'battle.'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'Ever since he met a certain'
	R
	'woman. Before that, fighting'
	R
	'was just a game to Lei...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'He once considered fighting to'
	R
	'be a natural thing and had no'
	R
	'remorse about the taking of'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'life.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'Mary...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d8f:
	ZH 1:
