	\L_02dab:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d8f:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜knock knock）'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'Lei remained silent as he'
	R
	'knocked on the door.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Lei... Welcome home...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	!VAR0516 : 446!
	\L_02e1b:
	\L_02dff:
	ZH 1:
	'The door slowly opened and'
	R
	'revealed an old woman on the'
	R
	'other side.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'...Glad to be back...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d8f:
	ZH 1:
	'Lei said a little bashfully.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Huhu...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'I wonder how many years it’s'
	R
	'been that I could tell it’s you'
	R
	'just from the way you knock...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'Mary...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'You don’t need to say a thing...'
	R
	'I understand you without any'
	R
	'need for words...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'You’re tired, I’m sure.'
	R
	'Come in. I’ll make some tea.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'Mary...'
	R
	'But I...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'You came because you’re tired'
	R
	'from fighting, didn’t you?'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'Then come in and rest.'
	R
	'The least I can do is make you'
	R
	'some tea...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'You don’t need to do that!!'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d8f:
	ZH 1:
	'Lei had the urge to hug Mary'
	R
	'tight, but upon seeing his own'
	R
	'hands emitting sparks,'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'pulled them back.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'...You don’t need to do that.'
	R
	'You’re always helping me,'
	R
	'Mary...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d73:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... Since that day 37 years'
	R
	'ago...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'After I lost a fight with'
	R
	'Kayblis, Mary nursed my injured'
	R
	'body with all she could.'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'Even on the verge of death, my'
	R
	'body was emitting'
	R
	'electricity...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'But even when she was shocked,'
	R
	'she wouldn’t let me die.'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'Even other demons hate my'
	R
	'body...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'She was the first person that'
	R
	'ever treated me so tenderly...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'When I woke up and saw her'
	R
	'hair and hands tinged with'
	R
	'burns... I...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Here you go, Lei.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'...Ah... Yeah...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'...Lei...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'You never look like you enjoy'
	R
	'fighting... I don’t understand'
	R
	'why you do it...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'You might die yourself...'
	R
	'And you take the lives of'
	R
	'others, too...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'And I’m worried that every'
	R
	'time you fight, it hurts your'
	R
	'soul...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Can’t you get out of fighting'
	R
	'somehow, Lei...?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d73:
	ZH 1:
	'...I can’t...'
	R
	'If I refuse to fight, Kayblis'
	R
	'will kill you...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'He’s threatening you...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'So...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m a demon.'
	R
	'Fighting is what I live for.'
	R
	'So it’s fine.'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'As a human you probably don’t'
	R
	'understand, though...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02de3:
	ZH 1:
	'You’re so bad at lying...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'You’ve been alive much longer'
	R
	'than me, but you’re still'
	R
	'straightforward. That’s why...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Lei... I love you.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02de3:
	ZH 1:
	'This is all I can do...'
	R
	'Pretend to fall for your lies'
	R
	'and watch over you...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'As I’ll die before you, this'
	R
	'is all I can do...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Are you embarrassed?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t be stupid...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Huhu...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'Uu...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'Mary!?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Cough... Cough...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'Mary!'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... I’m fine...'
	R
	'Just a little cough...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d73:
	ZH 1:
	'Mary caught an unknown'
	R
	'illness... I want to do'
	R
	'something about it...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'...No, Lei.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'You’re thinking of having me'
	R
	'meet with this Kesselring man to'
	R
	'make me immortal again,'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'aren’t you?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'If you did, you wouldn’t have'
	R
	'to suffer from this illness...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s okay... This is my fate...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll be sad to part with you,'
	R
	'Lei, but this is part of what'
	R
	'it means to be human...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'I have no intention of defying'
	R
	'the fate imposed upon me...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'Mary...!'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'But I do love you, Lei...'
	R
	'I’ll love you forever...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Now, maybe I should start'
	R
	'again.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'...Knitting?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes.'
	R
	'What color of sweater would'
	R
	'you like next, Lei?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'...Whatever color you like,'
	R
	'Mary.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Huhu... I’ll make it bright'
	R
	'green, then. I think it’ll'
	R
	'complement your hair well.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'...I don’t want it if it'
	R
	'doesn’t match you.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Huhu... I’ll make a matching'
	R
	'one for myself too, then.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'...Mind if I watch?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Not at all...'
	R
	'As long as it doesn’t bore you.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'...I won’t get bored.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d73:
	ZH 1:
	'The time we spend together is'
	R
	'the only time when I’m happy...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d8f:
	ZH 1:
	'Lei thought as he watched Mary.'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'He spent time with his beloved'
