	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	!VAR0516 : 496!
	\L_02e1b:
	\L_02dff:
	ZH 1:
	'A man that appeared to be a'
	R
	'villager rubbed his hands'
	R
	'together as he approached Rance.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'I have some information I’d'
	R
	'like to sell you...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'What did you say?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Hii... Please don’t threaten'
	R
	'me... It’s not information that'
	R
	'would be unfavorable to you...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s about a demon...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'A demon, you say?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Y-Yes. There’s a tiny old woman'
	R
	'named Mary that lives in a cabin'
	R
	'on the outskirts of this city.'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'Not too long ago, I saw a man'
	R
	'with electricity discharging'
	R
	'from his body visiting her.'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'I thought it was a strange'
	R
	'thing for a human being, and'
	R
	'other people saw him too...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'He seems to frequently stop by'
	R
	'there.'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'And each time there’s a'
	R
	'lightning-like phenomenon...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d73:
	ZH 1:
	'An electric demon...'
	R
	'Is it Lei...?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'So as I was saying before. This'
	R
	'old woman’s human, but she’s'
	R
	'keeping company with a demon...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'I think that might be why she'
	R
	'lives alone in that desolate'
	R
	'place...'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'She could be a demon spy.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'I see.'
	R
	'That’s some good info.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Heh...'
	R
	'Eheheh...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, here’s your reward.'
	R
	'Be thankful.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dff:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜ching）'
	\L_02e7c:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance tossed 1 GOLD at the'
	R
	'man’s feet.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...? That’s it...?'
	R
	'Even 10000 GOLD wouldn’t be'
	R
	'good enough for that info...'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d57:
	ZH 1:
	'...Hoh... Are you dissatisfied'
	R
	'with the 1 GOLD you received'
	R
	'from the King himself?'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02dc7:
	ZH 1:
	'N-No! It’s great! I’m very'
	R
	'thankful!! Thank you so much!!'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02e29:
	\L_02dff:
	ZH 1:
	'The man picked up the 1 GOLD'
	R
	'and ran away from Rance.'
	\L_02e7c:
	\L_02e6f:
	\L_02d73:
	ZH 1:
	'A demon and an old woman...?'
	R
	'A strange pair. Maybe I should'
	R
	'go check them out.'
